  "interpretation": "Every actual GPU instance and all eight rigid-body uniforms have their current/previous matrices compared exactly against pure Render IR and independent last-observed snapshots; all 40-float instance uploads are checked against the CPU mirror. The isolated transparent single has no shadow/reflection role; independent clip testing verifies hidden uploads remain unchanged and reentry uses its current pose. Scene stepping and visual edits occur before rendering; physical hashes must remain unchanged across render and match between visibility modes. Read-only diagnostic dispatches, readbacks and queue waits occur after production rendering. This establishes correctness of the exercised cases, not performance, canonical repeatability or competitive quality.",
